  "copy": {
    "tweets": [
      "1/8 Enterprises do not lack AI tools. The harder question is whether AI can move a real task—such as a quote, inventory decision, or supplier exception—to a verifiable result.",
      "2/8 In real operations, a quote is connected to inventory and delivery. Procurement depends on supplier capacity and price conditions. Finance depends on orders, receivables, payables, and fulfillment status.",
      "3/8 This is why JovaAI focuses on enterprise AI and industrial AI: AI must understand business objects, permissions, responsibilities, and handoffs—not only generate fluent text.",
      "4/8 JovaAI has accumulated six years of industrial experience across 300+ industries, 300,000 registered enterprises, 3,000+ leading enterprises, and RMB 60B in industrial transactions.",
      "5/8 Those figures have precise boundaries: registered enterprises are not paid customers; industrial transaction volume is not revenue; 3,000+ functional units are not 3,000 agents.",
      "6/8 JovaAI ICB models the relationships among products, prices, customers, suppliers, orders, contracts, credit, fulfillment, delivery, and settlement as composable industrial capabilities.",
      "7/8 We evaluate value at three levels: task completion, operational control and traceability, then business outcomes measured against a defined baseline and attribution boundary.",
      "8/8 Start with one bounded, observable task. Define the data, roles, permissions, exceptions, and success measures. Validate in a small scope before expanding. What task would you test first?"
    ],
    "chineseReview": [
      "企业并不缺AI工具，难的是AI能否把报价、库存或供应商异常等真实任务推进到可验证结果。",
      "真实运营中的业务对象彼此相连。",
      "艾氪智能因此聚焦企业AI与产业AI。",
      "陈述6年与五项产业积累数据。",
      "明确数据口径边界。",
      "解释JovaAI ICB的交易对象建模作用。",
      "以任务、运行、经营三层验证价值。",
      "建议从一个边界清楚的任务小范围验证。"
    ],
